<1000 -> Org A, 1000-10000 -> Org B, >10000 -> Org C.

Write distribute_invoice(total, num_orgs) returning {"amount_per_org": X, "category": "A/B/C"}.', '', '', '', 'def distribute_invoice(total, num_orgs):
